<section class="epa-rt">
  <div class="epa-rt-card">
    <header class="epa-rt-head">
      <div class="epa-rt-title">
        <div>
          <h2>Responsive Travel</h2>
          <div class="epa-rt-sub">Adventure with responsibility — for people, culture, and nature.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="epa-rt-badge">Explore Higher. Feel Deeper</div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="epa-rt-body">
      <div class="epa-rt-content">
        <p>
          At Ever Peak Adventure, we believe that adventure and responsibility go hand in hand. Exploring the Himalayas is a privilege,
          and it comes with a duty to protect the natural environment, respect local communities, and preserve Nepal’s cultural heritage.
          Every journey we plan is designed with sustainability in mind, so your adventure leaves a positive impact on the places you visit.
        </p>

        <p>
          We are committed to sustainable trekking and travel practices. Our itineraries are carefully crafted to minimize environmental impact,
          reduce waste, and protect fragile ecosystems. We encourage travelers to follow “Leave No Trace” principles, avoid single-use plastics,
          and respect wildlife habitats. By working with local accommodations, guides, and service providers, we ensure your travel supports
          the economic and social well-being of communities along the trails.
        </p>

        <p>
          Cultural respect is at the heart of every journey we organize. Our guides help travelers understand local customs, traditions, and ethical behavior,
          creating opportunities for meaningful interaction with local communities. From visiting remote villages to experiencing local festivals,
          we aim to make your journey not only adventurous, but also enriching and respectful.
        </p>

        <p>
          Safety and education go hand in hand with responsibility. Our team prepares travelers with high-altitude awareness, waste management guidance,
          and ethical trekking practices, so every participant becomes a responsible traveler. By promoting awareness and mindfulness,
          we inspire choices that benefit both people and the planet.
        </p>

        <div class="epa-rt-cta">
          <p>
            By choosing Ever Peak Adventure, you are not just exploring Nepal — you are joining a movement of responsible travelers who care for the environment,
            uplift local communities, and honor the traditions of the Himalayas. Together, we can ensure these breathtaking landscapes and vibrant cultures
            thrive for generations to come.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="epa-rt-aside">
        <h3>Our Responsible Commitments</h3>

        <ul class="epa-rt-points">
          <li class="epa-rt-point">
            <div class="epa-rt-ico" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
            <div>
              <b>Leave No Trace</b>
              <span>Reduce waste, avoid single-use plastics, and keep trails clean.</span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="epa-rt-point">
            <div class="epa-rt-ico" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
            <div>
              <b>Support Local Communities</b>
              <span>Work with local guides, porters, and businesses to strengthen local livelihoods.</span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="epa-rt-point">
            <div class="epa-rt-ico" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
            <div>
              <b>Respect Culture & Traditions</b>
              <span>Learn local customs and behave ethically during village and monastery visits.</span>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="epa-rt-point">
            <div class="epa-rt-ico" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
            <div>
              <b>Safety & Education</b>
              <span>High-altitude awareness, responsible trekking guidance, and mindful travel.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer class="epa-rt-foot">
      <small>Ever Peak Adventure • Responsible Trekking & Travel</small>
      <a class="epa-rt-tag" href="javascript:void(0)" aria-label="Responsible Travel">
        Responsible Travel Promise
      </a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</section>","jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"29e5b10"}]},"elements":[],"widgetType":"html"}],"isInner":false}]

